OL,3,GNEWSARovers first EFL club to install
OL,4,Afree period products
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol Rovers Football Club has become
OL,7,Fthe first team in the English Football
OL,8,FLeague (EFL) to offer free period
OL,9,Fproducts at their stadium.
OL,11,FThe club has installed period product
OL,12,Fdispensers made by DAME, a company
OL,13,Fwhich produces organic and sustainable
OL,14,Fsanitary products, at their Memorial
OL,15,FStadium.
OL,17,FThe installation is the latest
OL,18,Finitiative delivered through their
OL,19,Fpartnership with Her Game Too, which
OL,20,Faims to help make football a more
OL,21,Finclusive environment.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
