OL,3,GNEWSARovers first EFL club to install
OL,4,Afree period products
OL,5,
OL,6,FMitch Waddon, head of media and
OL,7,Fengagement, said the initiative was a
OL,8,F"small but significant step in making
OL,9,Fsure that everyone who comes to the
OL,10,FMemorial Stadium feels welcome,
OL,11,Fcomfortable and able to enjoy their
OL,12,Fmatchday experience."
